   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- Make sure every student finished the reporting `reportValue()` transaction.\n",
    "- GTA now calls `processUpdate()` to trigger the update and reward distribution.\n",
    "- We can go to the etherscan page of the contract and check the latest oracle value using `readValue()`. Is it close to the correct value? Why or why not?\n",
    "- We should find that the adversarial values do not affect the oracle value. This is because the oracle takes the median of all reported values, so as long as less than 50% of the values are adversarial, the oracle value will not be affected. In this case, since only 1/3 of the values are adversarial, the median value will still be the correct value."
   ]
  },
